            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Uziya aca araraka; kandi yar’ afise icotero mu ntoke, agira ngo yose imibavu. Akirakiye abo baherezi, imibembe isēsa mu ruhanga rwiwe, akir’ aho nyene imbere y’ abaherezi mu ngoro y’Uhoraho, i ruhande y’igicaniro coserezwakw imibavu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Azariya umuherezi mukuru n’abandi baherezi bose bagize ngo baramurāba, babona imibembe ishēshe mu ruhanga rwiwe; bakwakwanya kumusunika ngw ahave, na we nyene ubgiwe yihuta gusohoka, kuk’ Uhoraho amuteje indwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
