        {
          "text": "Nuk’ umwami Uziya arinda atanga akir’ umunyamibembe, aba mu nzu ya wenyene kubg’ imibembe yiwe, kukw atemerewe kuza mu ngoro y’Uhoraho; maze Yotamu umwana wiwe ni we yagaba ivyo mu rugo i bgami, agacira abantu bo mu gihugu imanza.",
