        {
          "text": "Nuko Uziya ahamvya ba sekuruza, bamuhamba hamwe na bo; mugabo bamushira ukwiwe mw itongo rihambgamw’ abami, kuko bāvuga kw ar’ umunyamibembe. Maz’ uwo muhungu wiwe Yotamu asubira ku ngoma yiwe.",
